ideos, and craft your own music-synced gameplay spectacle! Dead as Disco is a UGC mosh pit ready for modding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Martial arts meets music video in Dead as Disco, a neon-drenched Beat ‘Em Up where every punch, kick, and combo syncs to the music. Join Charlie Disco on a quest to confront the villainous Idols and reunite the band.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Dead as Disco is easily one of the best indie games I've ever played”<br>TechRadar<br><br>“Sorry GTA 6, I've got a new most-anticipated game”<br>TheGamer<br><br>“It's a vivid, unrestrained romp that lets you brawl through music videos like a kung-fu Baby Driver”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/ae0f4b71735adf4f2494ecb7914fcbafee215277/header.jpg?t=1785773022", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/c047bcb51618b08b5764cc3a5c15f1b50511e4ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785773022", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/c047bcb51618b08b5764cc3a5c15f1b50511e4ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785773022", "website": "https://deadasdisco.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500, AMD Ryzen 5 1400, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 6GB, AMD Radeon RX 580, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Brain Jar Games, Inc."], "publishers": 